{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/AboutThisGame.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Dare to Enter</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shed Skin, Bleed Ink</strong> is a visually striking, boundary-breaking, experimental game where you explore\u2014or confine\u2014your identity by carving sigils into your flesh under the guidance of the Overseer. Your ultimate goal: to reincarnate the Prophet in perfect alignment with the Observatory's sacred vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/GameplayFeature.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">=<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/sigilCube.gif?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Find Sigils in a Fragmented Reality</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter a surreal realm transcending space and time, where broken realities collide. Each sigil you find is a piece of the sacred puzzle. Now, every decision you make will shape the reincarnation. Analyze and choose carefully\u2014each sigil carries weight in the rebirth of the Prophet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/SmallerHand.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Inscribe Sigils on Your Flesh</strong><br><strong></strong>To forge the connection with the Prophet, you\u2019ll inscribe sigils onto your <strong><i>physical skin</i></strong>, bridging the gap between the digital and the physical world.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/Flashy.png?t=1744181581\" /><strong>\u26a1 Experience a Visually Striking Digital Ritual</strong><br><strong></strong>Immerse yourself in a visually intense, 3D experimental world with sequences designed to provoke thought and challenge perception. (Warning: Some scenes may cause heavy eye strain.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/AboutDevelopment.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Developers</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In creating the game for Peter Brinson's Intermediate course at USC, the developers aimed to make something weird and unique. They invite you to this boundary-pushing experience to explore identity in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290150?t=1744181581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3290150?t=1744181581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/540553b269cdfa455ba87aad1493a3909a1cd4bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744181581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/540553b269cdfa455ba87aad1493a3909a1cd4bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744181581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/AboutThisGame.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Dare to Enter</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shed Skin, Bleed Ink</strong> is a visually striking, boundary-breaking, experimental game where you explore\u2014or confine\u2014your identity by carving sigils into your flesh under the guidance of the Overseer. Your ultimate goal: to reincarnate the Prophet in perfect alignment with the Observatory's sacred vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/GameplayFeature.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">=<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/sigilCube.gif?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Find Sigils in a Fragmented Reality</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter a surreal realm transcending space and time, where broken realities collide. Each sigil you find is a piece of the sacred puzzle. Now, every decision you make will shape the reincarnation. Analyze and choose carefully\u2014each sigil carries weight in the rebirth of the Prophet.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/SmallerHand.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Inscribe Sigils on Your Flesh</strong><br><strong></strong>To forge the connection with the Prophet, you\u2019ll inscribe sigils onto your <strong><i>physical skin</i></strong>, bridging the gap between the digital and the physical world.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/Flashy.png?t=1744181581\" /><strong>\u26a1 Experience a Visually Striking Digital Ritual</strong><br><strong></strong>Immerse yourself in a visually intense, 3D experimental world with sequences designed to provoke thought and challenge perception. (Warning: Some scenes may cause heavy eye strain.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/extras/AboutDevelopment.png?t=1744181581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Developers</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In creating the game for Peter Brinson's Intermediate course at USC, the developers aimed to make something weird and unique. They invite you to this boundary-pushing experience to explore identity in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Anik Panja","Boston Moreland","Charles Greenberg","Nicholas Urricelqui","Senyao Yang"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290150/header.jpg?t=1744181581","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121522/movie480.mp4?t=1744181580","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121522/movie_max.mp4?t=1744181580"},"name":"Trailer Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121522/53c3f75d413605a4a38546d8aabadae65d2c474c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744181580","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121522/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744181580","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121522/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744181580"}}],"name":"Shed Skin, Bleed Ink","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["USC Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_ga